    comment "en" """
        Source W8594 = SNOMED CT 242789001 (Swedish national extension). Base W85 Athena-crosswalks to
        SNOMED CT 4055054 (concept_code 242789001) via ICD10 relationship 45756330 -> 4055054. The Swedish
        extension subdivides the base event by a place/activity/qualifier axis with no distinct standard
        SNOMED CT clinical analogue; the underlying clinical event is unchanged. Target subsumes the source
        event -> broader. Confidence : verified Athena crosswalk on base W85, one-level broader (Swedish
        qualifier dropped).
        """
}
